:: MP Job Cafe Encounter 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobCafeEncounter to 1>>
《海风日报》的记者把三只空杯在吧台上一字排开。他说离截稿只剩一刻钟，三杯必须各不相同：一杯深烘黑咖啡、一杯肉桂摩卡、一杯双份奶泡拿铁。靠窗二桌的退休领航员温特斯照例坐着，黑咖啡里要撒一撮盐，等得不耐烦就用杯垫在桌沿敲两下。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")>>格威岚<<else>>杂货店主<</if>>在烘豆机后头腾不出手，只朝你抬了抬下巴。
<br><br>
<div id="mp-job-cafe-enc2">
<<mpcookicon>><<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 220>><<link "三壶并火分萃 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#mp-job-cafe-enc2">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240 or random(1, 3) gte 2>>
	你把三只壶同时架上火，深烘那壶守着时间，摩卡的肉桂棒和可可膏隔水化开，奶泡另用一只小壶打。三杯并排推过去时，颜色从深到浅分得清清楚楚，记者逐杯抿过，在稿纸上写了两行，把加急稿酬按在吧台上。<span class="green">三杯都赶在截稿前交了出去。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_cafe_enc_3_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 800>><</if>>
	<<housekeeping 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	你顾着摩卡的奶泡，深烘那壶在火上多坐了半分钟，苦味压过了头，第三杯的奶泡也塌了。记者看了看表，把本子塞回口袋，说改天再来。温特斯的黑咖啡也凉在窗边。<span class="red">三杯没能一起交出去。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Cafe]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[返回咖啡馆 (0:08)|Ocean Breeze]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[三壶并火分萃 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "三壶并火分萃">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "家政等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mpbargainicon>><<if ($money or 0) gte 200>><<link "买糕稳住常客 (0:04)">><<pass 4>><<replace "#mp-job-cafe-enc2">>
你从围裙口袋里数出两枚银币，让糕点柜后的小工切一碟肉桂卷送到窗边，又笑着告诉温特斯黑咖啡稍等片刻。老领航员用叉子敲了敲碟沿，没再催。你腾出手把三只保温壶里的底咖分别加热、重新打奶泡，赶在记者合上本子前把三杯并排推过去。<span class="green">窗边和吧台都安静了下来。</span>
<<money -200>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_cafe_enc_4_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 520>><</if>>
<<stress -1>><<lstress>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Cafe]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[返回咖啡馆 (0:08)|Ocean Breeze]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">买糕稳住常客 (0:04)（钱不够）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<mpreadicon>><<if ($mpJobCafeLevel or 0) gte 2>><<link "照熟客簿配单 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-job-cafe-enc2">>
你翻开吧台下的熟客簿，先照温特斯的旧单送上一杯撒盐黑咖啡。老领航员端起杯子，敲垫的手停在半空。你按簿子上记的偏好把深烘、摩卡和拿铁分壶配好，三杯的颜色和香气各不相同。记者终于坐稳，稿纸翻得飞快。<span class="green">这一单没再出岔子。</span>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_cafe_enc_5_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 350>><</if>>
<<tending 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")>><<npcincr Gwylan love 1>><</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Cafe]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[返回咖啡馆 (0:08)|Ocean Breeze]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">照熟客簿配单 (0:05)（还不熟悉熟客）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Cafe]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Job Cafe Encounter 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobCafeEncounter to 1>>
雨从屋檐的裂口倒灌进来，靠窗二桌正上方洇开一片深色水痕，一滴一滴落进温特斯那杯撒了盐的黑咖啡里。老领航员皱着眉，用杯垫在桌沿敲了两下。后厨同时探出头来：河湾农场的面粉车还堵在雨里，午市的司康只剩半袋。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")>>格威岚<<else>>杂货店主<</if>>把两条干布塞进你怀里，又指了指天花板。
<br><br>
<div id="mp-job-cafe-enc3">
<<mpclimbicon>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 220>><<link "爬梁铺油布 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-job-cafe-enc3">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 240 or random(1, 3) gte 2>>
	你踩着吧台边的矮凳翻上横梁，把油布四角压在瓦条下，又用麻绳在漏水最急的地方兜了一道导水的斜槽。雨水顺着布角淌到后墙，窗边二桌终于不再落水。你跳下来时，厨房学徒也把面粉车接进了后门。<span class="green">屋顶和后厨都撑住了。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_cafe_enc_6_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 600>><</if>>
	<<athletics 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	横梁上全是湿滑的苔，你脚下一滑，膝盖磕在瓦条上，油布只铺开一半就垂了下来。水珠仍往窗边落，温特斯把杯子挪开，脸色不太好看。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")>>格威岚<<else>>杂货店主<</if>>在下面喊你先下来，面粉车也还堵在雨里。<span class="red">这一趟白爬了。</span><<pain 2>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Cafe]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[返回咖啡馆 (0:08)|Ocean Breeze]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[爬梁铺油布 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "爬梁铺油布">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "运动等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mpfishicon>><<if ($mpJobFishLevel or 0) gte 2>><<link "借鱼档油布 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-job-cafe-enc3">>
你想起鱼档今早送冰筐时留下的那张柏油布还搭在后门。你把它拖进来盖在漏水处，四角用鱼篓压住，水线立刻改道；剩下的半幅正好裹住后厨那袋快受潮的面粉。鱼档的伙计在雨里喊你改天补两杯咖啡就行。<span class="green">漏水和面粉都暂时有了着落。</span>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_cafe_enc_7_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 500>><</if>>
<<stress -1>><<lstress>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Cafe]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[返回咖啡馆 (0:08)|Ocean Breeze]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">借鱼档油布 (0:05)（鱼档还没这份交情）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<mpwatchicon>><<link "先挪常客茶桌 (0:03)">><<pass 3>><<replace "#mp-job-cafe-enc3">>
你顺着水痕往上看，发现漏点正好在温特斯头顶那盏吊灯上方。你把二桌往干爽的里侧挪开半步，又把铜桶踢到滴水线下接住，顺手替他换了杯没落进雨水的黑咖啡。老领航员用杯垫敲了两下，这回是满意的意思。<span class="teal">窗边总算没再淋着人。</span>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_cafe_enc_8_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 300>><</if>>
<<stress -1>><<lstress>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Cafe]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[返回咖啡馆 (0:08)|Ocean Breeze]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpbargainicon>><<if ($money or 0) gte 250>><<link "掏钱买急面 (0:04)">><<pass 4>><<replace "#mp-job-cafe-enc3">>
你数出两枚银币和一把铜板，托同一条街上面包房的送货学徒先匀一袋磨好的白面过来。学徒披着雨布跑了两趟，后厨的司康总算接上了。你回身把湿透的桌布换掉，又拿干布把窗台擦了一遍。<span class="teal">午市的面点没有断档。</span>
<<money -250>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_cafe_enc_9_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 560>><</if>>
<<stress -1>><<lstress>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Cafe]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[返回咖啡馆 (0:08)|Ocean Breeze]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">掏钱买急面 (0:04)（钱不够）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Cafe]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
</div>
